  "notes": "{計算|けいさん} has two main uses: (1) mathematical calculation, and (2) strategic thinking or taking something into account when planning.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {計算|けいさん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to calculate\n- {計算|けいさん}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{入|い}れる→入れる：01098_ireru⟧: to take into account, to factor in\n- {計算|けいさん}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{合|あ}う→合う：10466_au⟧: the numbers add up\n- {計算|けいさん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{間違|まちが}える→間違える：01109_machigaeru⟧: to make a calculation error\n- {計算|けいさん}⟦{高|だか}い→高い：00500_takai⟧: calculating, scheming (describes a person who acts strategically for personal gain)\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{計算|けいさん}{機|き}→計算機：17831_keisanki⟧: calculator\n- ⟦{暗算|あんざん}→暗算：15852_anzan⟧: mental calculation\n- ⟦{誤算|ごさん}→誤算：08679_gosan⟧: miscalculation\n- ⟦{計算|けいさん}{式|しき}→計算式：27948_keisanshiki⟧: mathematical formula/expression\n\nThe figurative sense appears in expressions like {計算|けいさん}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦ある→ある：00006_aru⟧ (there is calculation behind something) and {計算|けいさん}⟦{高|だか}い→高い：00500_takai⟧⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧ (a calculating person), both carrying a somewhat negative nuance of self-interested scheming.",
